      "body": "## Motivation\r\n\r\nThe Muse Spark launch test simulates NVIDIA GPUs, but ModelConfig still reads the host's real HIP status. On ROCm, this rejects the simulated FP4 configuration before the launch assertions run.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\nMock `ModelConfig.is_hip` alongside the existing NVIDIA platform override. Keep all assertions and production code unchanged.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\nOn MI355X / ROCm 10, upstream a8106545 failed all four Blackwell/Hopper quantization subtests. With this change, all four passed. Formatting and lint passed. Hosted CI is pending.\r\n\r\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\r\r\n---\r\r\n### CI States\r\r\n\r\r\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41158568803](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41158568803)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\r\r\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41158568748](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41158568748)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\r\r\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41158568747](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41158568747)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\r\r\n<!-- pr-states:end -->\r\n",
